{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lo-fi beats to fold to.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A collection of the chill tracks featured in Paper 2 - Origami Refolded. These tracks have a calm, but focused mood - definitely downtempo, but not necessarily ambient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note that while the game has a layered music system that procedurally changes as you fold, the songs in this soundtrack are faithful renderings that capture the vibes of the 7 distinct tracks included in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All of the tracks are purely instrumental, without lyrics or vocals, with tempos in the range of 76 to 91 BPM provided as 192kbps MP3 files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The total runtime of all tracks combined is 23 minutes, 46 seconds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572790?t=1741228173","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572790?t=1741228173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572790/862e338cf072a49b7bb07ff421c22563a7e0bf5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741228173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572790/862e338cf072a49b7bb07ff421c22563a7e0bf5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741228173","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lo-fi beats to fold to.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A collection of the chill tracks featured in Paper 2 - Origami Refolded. These tracks have a calm, but focused mood - definitely downtempo, but not necessarily ambient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note that while the game has a layered music system that procedurally changes as you fold, the songs in this soundtrack are faithful renderings that capture the vibes of the 7 distinct tracks included in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">